1
00:00:46,560 --> 00:00:47,679
Jiushuang, don't worry.

2
00:00:47,799 --> 00:00:48,920
You're from the Mei Family.

3
00:00:49,039 --> 00:00:50,880
That Sheng Lingyu won't dare touch you.

4
00:00:54,079 --> 00:00:57,920
Actually, the Dragon-Seeking Lineage's
Zhang Family still has a descendant.

5
00:00:58,359 --> 00:01:00,320
I strive to be Head of the Four Clans.

6
00:01:00,679 --> 00:01:02,640
I'll surely help you find the Tidal Tomb.

7
00:01:06,120 --> 00:01:07,920
Is everything you said true?

8
00:01:08,239 --> 00:01:09,519
Jiushuang.

9
00:01:09,519 --> 00:01:11,319
How could I ever bear to lie to you?

10
00:01:11,439 --> 00:01:13,680
Once I become the Mei Family son-in-law,

11
00:01:13,680 --> 00:01:15,079
I will find that descendant

12
00:01:15,079 --> 00:01:16,879
and save the four families from disaster.

13
00:01:23,400 --> 00:01:25,079
Jiushuang, don't worry.

14
00:01:25,200 --> 00:01:26,640
Even if I'm imprisoned,

15
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:30,280
I'd risk my life to keep you safe.

16
00:01:33,920 --> 00:01:36,840
He's really playing the devoted lover.

17
00:01:40,519 --> 00:01:40,879
What are you doing?

18
00:01:40,879 --> 00:01:41,640
What are you doing?

19
00:01:41,640 --> 00:01:42,439
Let me go!

20
00:01:42,480 --> 00:01:42,879
Hey!

21
00:01:42,879 --> 00:01:43,680
What are you doing?!

22
00:01:43,760 --> 00:01:45,040
Where are you taking him?

23
00:01:46,200 --> 00:01:47,000
Li Xiao!

24
00:01:47,400 --> 00:01:48,480
Li Xiao!

25
00:01:48,480 --> 00:01:50,280
Why are you taking him?

26
00:01:58,200 --> 00:01:59,200
I'm exhausted.

27
00:02:10,520 --> 00:02:11,319
Mouse!

28
00:02:11,400 --> 00:02:12,520
Did you see that just now?

29
00:02:12,520 --> 00:02:13,520
I saw it.

30
00:02:13,719 --> 00:02:14,919
It looked like a person.

31
00:02:15,319 --> 00:02:17,039
But maybe it wasn't.

32
00:02:21,560 --> 00:02:22,960
I think I touched it.

33
00:02:28,039 --> 00:02:29,560
A ghost!

34
00:02:34,240 --> 00:02:35,479
Mouse!

35
00:02:36,159 --> 00:02:37,599
Mouse!

36
00:02:40,560 --> 00:02:43,479
Mouse!

37
00:02:45,879 --> 00:02:47,159
Mouse!

38
00:02:50,759 --> 00:02:51,520
Young Master!

39
00:02:53,120 --> 00:02:54,599
What are you running around for?

40
00:02:54,599 --> 00:02:55,800
How dare you run around here?

41
00:02:55,800 --> 00:02:56,599
Do you have a death wish?

42
00:03:11,800 --> 00:03:12,719
Qi Tianting!

43
00:03:20,639 --> 00:03:22,159
Li Xiao, you're really something.

44
00:03:24,840 --> 00:03:26,400
I want the item.

45
00:03:26,400 --> 00:03:27,759
And I want her, too.

46
00:03:29,199 --> 00:03:30,520
So, what do we do next?

47
00:03:31,599 --> 00:03:33,599
Next?

48
00:03:34,960 --> 00:03:38,400
Next, we get down to business, of course.

49
00:03:49,400 --> 00:03:50,759
Qi Tianting!

50
00:03:50,759 --> 00:03:51,759
Why are you here?

51
00:03:53,199 --> 00:03:55,479
That bastard Qi Tiankun!

52
00:03:56,560 --> 00:03:58,599
He locked me up here to die!

53
00:04:00,639 --> 00:04:01,840
Zhang Tianyou!

54
00:04:03,199 --> 00:04:04,719
Speaking of which...

55
00:04:04,719 --> 00:04:06,960
This is all your fault!

56
00:04:06,960 --> 00:04:07,800
Watch your mouth!

57
00:04:07,800 --> 00:04:09,240
You two fight over the family fortune,

58
00:04:09,240 --> 00:04:10,319
how does that concern our Young Master?

59
00:04:10,319 --> 00:04:11,800
Still making sarcastic remarks?

60
00:04:12,039 --> 00:04:13,639
I'll... I'll strangle you!

61
00:04:13,639 --> 00:04:14,599
Come on, try it! Come on!

62
00:04:14,599 --> 00:04:15,680
Okay, okay, okay.

63
00:04:17,199 --> 00:04:18,160
Cramp, cramp, cramp...

64
00:04:18,160 --> 00:04:19,000
I've got a cramp!

65
00:04:19,160 --> 00:04:20,959
H-h-help me!

66
00:04:20,959 --> 00:04:22,560
I've got a cramp!

67
00:04:22,759 --> 00:04:23,319
I've got a cramp!

68
00:04:25,560 --> 00:04:26,360
What's that sound?

69
00:04:27,639 --> 00:04:28,279
What is this?

70
00:04:33,319 --> 00:04:34,839
Who is it?

71
00:04:39,199 --> 00:04:39,800
Second Young Master.

72
00:04:39,800 --> 00:04:40,639
What's going on?

73
00:04:41,759 --> 00:04:42,560
Family Head.

74
00:04:46,240 --> 00:04:47,439
Who are you people?

75
00:04:48,079 --> 00:04:49,480
How dare you trespass on the Qi Family!

76
00:04:53,720 --> 00:04:55,160
I'm Li Xiao,

77
00:04:55,519 --> 00:04:57,519
the chosen son-in-law of the Mei Family.

78
00:04:57,759 --> 00:04:59,000
And if I wanted to,

79
00:04:59,600 --> 00:05:01,800
I could be the Sheng Family son-in-law.

80
00:05:01,800 --> 00:05:02,360
You...

81
00:05:02,360 --> 00:05:03,360
What do you want?

82
00:05:03,360 --> 00:05:04,360
Don't worry.

83
00:05:04,360 --> 00:05:06,000
Your Qi Family only has men,

84
00:05:06,079 --> 00:05:07,680
so I'm not interested.

85
00:05:10,959 --> 00:05:11,759
Then...

86
00:05:11,759 --> 00:05:14,360
Then why did you bring armed men here?

87
00:05:14,399 --> 00:05:15,879
The deadline is near.

88
00:05:15,920 --> 00:05:19,160
Even the Qi and Sheng Family Heads
couldn't escape disaster.

89
00:05:22,199 --> 00:05:23,720
I'm obviously here to save you,

90
00:05:23,720 --> 00:05:27,360
the last remaining heir of the Qi Family.

91
00:05:28,240 --> 00:05:31,120
I have the Earth Vein Sutra
and the Celestial Seal now,

92
00:05:31,360 --> 00:05:34,519
and the Talisman Book
is with your Qi Family.

93
00:05:35,600 --> 00:05:38,399
That leaves only the tricky Wan Family.

94
00:05:39,519 --> 00:05:40,839
The Wan Family?

95
00:05:40,839 --> 00:05:42,120
If the Wan Family

96
00:05:42,120 --> 00:05:44,600
sees I control the other three families,

97
00:05:45,079 --> 00:05:47,360
they'd risk their entire clan's lives

98
00:05:47,680 --> 00:05:50,079
than let me be Head of the Four Clans.

99
00:05:52,279 --> 00:05:55,560
I know exactly what those people are like.

100
00:06:00,160 --> 00:06:01,079
Li Xiao,

101
00:06:02,360 --> 00:06:03,759
what do you need me to do?

102
00:06:08,439 --> 00:06:09,959
All of you, step down for now.

103
00:06:16,519 --> 00:06:18,639
I want you to take over the Sheng Family,

104
00:06:18,639 --> 00:06:20,279
become their son-in-law,

105
00:06:20,360 --> 00:06:22,040
and then imprison Mei Jiushuang.

106
00:06:22,959 --> 00:06:25,319
Then, if the Wan and Mei families
want to find that tomb,

107
00:06:25,319 --> 00:06:27,240
they will target you.

108
00:06:28,160 --> 00:06:30,199
Once you're set up as the target,

109
00:06:30,240 --> 00:06:32,319
I'll step forward,

110
00:06:32,480 --> 00:06:34,920
pretending to help them deal with you.

111
00:06:35,240 --> 00:06:38,000
That way, everyone will only trust me.

112
00:06:38,720 --> 00:06:40,000
That's not fair to me.

113
00:06:40,399 --> 00:06:42,279
Qi Tiankun,

114
00:06:42,279 --> 00:06:46,000
only I can find that tomb
and save the entire clan.

115
00:06:46,000 --> 00:06:47,439
Got it?

116
00:06:50,079 --> 00:06:52,040
Then what should I do next?

117
00:06:52,879 --> 00:06:54,319
Make a big scene.

118
00:06:54,319 --> 00:06:56,040
Force Sheng Lingyu into marriage.

119
00:06:57,920 --> 00:06:58,879
All right.

120
00:07:14,240 --> 00:07:15,040
Young Master.

121
00:07:15,560 --> 00:07:16,560
Should we help him out?

122
00:07:19,639 --> 00:07:20,519
Sure.

123
00:07:20,879 --> 00:07:21,240
Here.

124
00:07:21,240 --> 00:07:22,240
Who needs your help?

125
00:07:22,240 --> 00:07:22,800
Let's go.

126
00:07:26,399 --> 00:07:28,120
You're just leaving like that?

127
00:07:28,240 --> 00:07:29,800
That's so irresponsible.

128
00:07:30,199 --> 00:07:31,439
Still acting tough?

129
00:07:31,759 --> 00:07:32,560
Wait.

130
00:07:32,759 --> 00:07:33,560
Fine.

131
00:07:33,560 --> 00:07:34,199
Come on.

132
00:07:38,959 --> 00:07:41,639
Qi Tianting, where exactly are we?

133
00:07:42,000 --> 00:07:43,040
This place?

134
00:07:43,240 --> 00:07:44,759
The secret room behind the Qi estate.

135
00:07:45,879 --> 00:07:48,319
My father discovered this place years ago.

136
00:07:48,319 --> 00:07:49,279
But he said

137
00:07:49,839 --> 00:07:50,759
because of the feng shui here,

138
00:07:50,759 --> 00:07:52,040
it is a Sinister Land.

139
00:07:52,399 --> 00:07:53,759
We can't go deep for tomb raiding.

140
00:07:54,240 --> 00:07:56,800
So he set up that Sealed Door outside.

141
00:07:58,879 --> 00:07:59,879
What's inside?

142
00:08:00,439 --> 00:08:01,759
It's a Sealed Door for a reason!

143
00:08:01,759 --> 00:08:03,600
It's sealed, so I don't know!

144
00:08:05,199 --> 00:08:06,959
But recently I've been locked in here,

145
00:08:07,279 --> 00:08:10,600
and I keep hearing strange noises.

146
00:08:20,000 --> 00:08:21,000
What is it?

147
00:08:24,959 --> 00:08:26,839
Did you see a shadow pass by?

148
00:08:26,839 --> 00:08:28,000
W-w-what shadow?

149
00:08:28,000 --> 00:08:28,720
Did that shadow have a head?

150
00:08:28,720 --> 00:08:30,480
Could it be that headless corpse?

151
00:08:30,480 --> 00:08:32,080
A headless corpse? How could it stand up?

152
00:08:32,080 --> 00:08:33,000
It's already a corpse!

153
00:08:33,480 --> 00:08:34,639
Maybe my eyes played tricks on me.

154
00:08:35,399 --> 00:08:36,600
Don't scare me!

155
00:08:36,600 --> 00:08:38,080
Young Master, I'm easily scared as it is.

156
00:08:38,080 --> 00:08:39,399
Don't scare me!

157
00:08:40,080 --> 00:08:40,759
What are you doing?

158
00:08:40,759 --> 00:08:41,720
What do you mean?

159
00:08:41,720 --> 00:08:42,639
Why did you tap me?

160
00:08:42,639 --> 00:08:44,039
Who tapped you?

161
00:08:51,080 --> 00:08:53,080
A ghost!
